          automatics: [ { name: "8-Speed Alpina Switch-Tronic (ZF 8HP76 Mild-Hybrid)", torqueLimit: "900+ Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 8", note: "An absolute masterpiece. This heavily revised, extreme-duty ZF 8-speed integrates the 48V mild-hybrid electric motor directly into the transmission housing. It features proprietary Alpina calibration and an enlarged aluminum oil sump. It provides instant torque-fill during gear shifts, making acceleration flawlessly smooth. Requires strict fluid and pan/filter replacement every 50k miles." } ]
